# MSSP Control Plane — Always-Applied Project Rules

This project is a private, multi-tenant, AI-assisted MSSP/SOC control plane. Full detail lives in `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` at the repository root — read them. This file is the condensed rule set Cursor injects into every request.

## Project Summary

- We are building a branded, web-based MSSP/SOC control plane — not a Wazuh dashboard, not a Streamlit prototype.
- Architecture: FastAPI backend + PostgreSQL + Redis + Docker Compose, with future separate admin and customer dashboard frontends.
- Wazuh, Suricata, MISP, TheHive/Cortex, Shuffle/n8n, Prometheus/Grafana are backend detection engines/adapters only. Customers never log into them directly.
- The platform is multi-tenant: SOC/admin dashboard manages all tenants; customer dashboard shows only that customer's own data.

